  "ledger": [
    "smartphone | held in two hands in foreground, screen showing 'A7.42'-style text with glare patches | lowered out of bottom of frame | camera zooms in ~00:03.0; right-hand fingers tap/swipe screen ~00:06.5-00:08.5; hands lower phone ~00:09.1 with plausible motion blur",
    "background walker (blue clothing, red bag) | mid-frame on upper path, walking away up steps | exits top of frame ~00:03.0 | continuous forward walking motion, bag swinging in step; motion is smooth with no teleporting or frozen beats",
    "phone screen content | text visible under glare | text remains on screen until phone is lowered | glare/shadow bands sweep across screen in step with phone tilt and handling; finger swipe produces no dramatic content change, consistent with a static readout",
    "sunlight/shadow on device | strong directional glare on screen | glare position shifts across frames | shifts correlate with slight phone reorientation and camera movement — plausible physical cause",
    "staircase/railing environment | static background with long shadows | unchanged in final empty frame | no motion expected, none observed"
  ],
